{"ref":"BDB, דְּלָיָ֫הוּ","hw":"דְּלָיָ֫הוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דְּלָיָ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּלָיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>Yah(u) hath drawn</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּלָיָהוּ</span>, <strong>a.</strong>  a priest, contemp. David, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.18\">1 Ch 24:18</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  a prince of Judah, contemp. Jerem <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.12\">Je 36:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.25\">25</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּלָיָה</span>, <strong>a.</strong>  head of a family contemp. with Zerubb. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:60\" href=\"/Ezra.2.60\">Ezr 2:60</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:61\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.61\">Ne 7:62</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  descendant of Zerubb. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.24\">1 Ch 3:24</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  father of contemp. of <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.10\">Neh. 6:10</a>.","next":"BDB, דָּלַח","prev":"BDB, דֶּ֫לֶת"}